{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/path-cli/tests/render_md_snapshots.rs","issuer":"mailto:benbarber121@gmail.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T14:10:59.563874Z","id":"55b81cf621d13652b2a15dad792efbb816d4a7ef06dbbf75dfaa4d738956ae31","body":{"detail":"Each earlier path example has a render_md snapshot (render_md_snapshots.rs:44-53 lists path-01..path-04), and most .path.jsonl examples go through a CLI integration test (crates/path-cli/tests/integration.rs:336-390). examples/path-05-continuation.path.json is checked only by schema_examples.rs, which validates *.json against the schema. examples/path-05-continuation.path.jsonl is never loaded by any test. It parses today (checked by hand with `path p validate`, and its sealed path identity matches the .json), but nothing catches drift between the two files or a regression in how toolpath-md renders the Parent header line, which this example is the only fixture for.","kind":"suggestion","span":{"start":{"line":44},"end":{"line":53},"content_hash":"c926896ad935eac7b061bad9b642d4456cb0f26cb23370fc150960660725a5e2"},"suggested_fix":"Add snapshot_test!(render_md_path_05_continuation, \"path-05-continuation.path.json\") with its snapshot, and an integration test that parses path-05-continuation.path.jsonl and asserts its path.parent equals the .json example's.","summary":"No test reads the new path-05 examples: the .path.jsonl is never parsed and the .path.json has no render snapshot","tags":["review","review:pr-354-qual-2","session:claude-code:2b4a790f-c163-4549-93fa-572ef111cb5e"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/path-cli/tests/render_md_snapshots.rs","issuer":"mailto:benbarber121@gmail.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T14:11:35.270927Z","id":"ff224c429d0763e1b514cf56a7090e58e7fbd9a5480e864baf36c945813632cf","body":{"detail":"render_md_snapshots.rs snapshots path-01 to path-04 (lines 44-55) but not examples/path-05-continuation.path.json, and crates/path-cli/tests/integration.rs exercises the .path.jsonl examples for validate/render/merge (lines 331-392) but not path-05-continuation.path.jsonl. The only checks on the new example are the JSON-schema test (crates/path-cli/tests/schema_examples.rs, .json only) and unit tests that build a Parent by hand. A regression that drops parent from the JSONL PathOpen reader or moves the md Parent line would go unnoticed on the one shipped document that uses the field. Today `path p validate --input examples/path-05-continuation.path.jsonl` succeeds and `p render md` prints `**Parent:** ... path `path-session-xyz` @ `step-003`` after Base.","kind":"suggestion","span":{"start":{"line":44},"end":{"line":55},"content_hash":"b04214ceb97da0b16931a1d4315784cbe19956c40e5f8ae96a3fa8ae065040f9"},"suggested_fix":"Add `snapshot_test!(render_md_path_05_continuation, \"path-05-continuation.path.json\");` with its accepted snapshot, and an integration test that renders path-05-continuation.path.jsonl and asserts the Parent line, so the JSONL parent round trip is covered end to end.","summary":"The new example path-05-continuation has no render snapshot or JSONL validate test, so the Parent header line on a real document is unpinned","tags":["review","review:pr-354-qual-2","session:claude-code:2b4a790f-c163-4549-93fa-572ef111cb5e"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/path-cli/tests/render_md_snapshots.rs","issuer":"mailto:benbarber121@gmail.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T14:14:02.169092Z","id":"0efe70de54b07aa277a5db7da99339919a2d7429e4bb14920eca98e8a9bda29d","body":{"detail":"crates/path-cli/tests/render_md_snapshots.rs:44-54 has snapshots only for path-01..path-04. `grep -rn 'path-05\\|path_05' crates --include=*.rs` returns nothing. crates/path-cli/tests/integration.rs:336-390 names path-01..04 .path.jsonl files only. crates/path-cli/tests/schema_examples.rs:30-34 reads examples/*.json only, so the .path.jsonl is never parsed by any test. One part of the detail is wrong: the Parent header line is not otherwise unpinned. crates/toolpath-md/src/lib.rs:1770-1777 (test_render_path_with_parent) asserts the '**Parent:**' line on a hand-built Parent. The untested parts are the shipped example and drift between its .json and .jsonl forms. Suggestion fits. This finding duplicates ff224c42 on the same file.","kind":"comment","references":"55b81cf621d13652b2a15dad792efbb816d4a7ef06dbbf75dfaa4d738956ae31","summary":"confirmed: no test loads examples/path-05-continuation.path.jsonl, and the .path.json has no render snapshot","tags":["verified:confirmed","session:claude-code:2b4a790f-c163-4549-93fa-572ef111cb5e"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/path-cli/tests/render_md_snapshots.rs","issuer":"mailto:benbarber121@gmail.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T14:14:02.179514Z","id":"8f050b05177e3a1b7b82511fcf9b416dc8536255fb7d6210a1402201ff0e3adb","body":{"detail":"crates/path-cli/tests/render_md_snapshots.rs:44-55 snapshots path-01..path-04 only; `grep -rn path-05 crates --include=*.rs` returns nothing, and crates/path-cli/tests/snapshots has no path_05 snapshot. Today `path p validate --input examples/path-05-continuation.path.jsonl` prints 'Valid: Graph (id: path-session-xyz-2, 1 path)'. suggestion is right. Same finding as open thread 55b81cf621d13652b2a15dad792efbb816d4a7ef06dbbf75dfaa4d738956ae31 on the same file (lines 44-53), so one of the two is a duplicate.","kind":"comment","references":"ff224c429d0763e1b514cf56a7090e58e7fbd9a5480e864baf36c945813632cf","summary":"confirmed: path-05-continuation has no render snapshot and no test parses its .path.jsonl","tags":["verified:confirmed","session:claude-code:2b4a790f-c163-4549-93fa-572ef111cb5e"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/path-cli/tests/render_md_snapshots.rs","issuer":"mailto:benbarber121@gmail.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T14:14:44.233471Z","id":"047c7fd0520088b3e226e0a5640d7069169389675734b64bfe39b536f42875ab","body":{"kind":"resolve","summary":"Duplicate of 55b81cf621d13652b2a15dad792efbb816d4a7ef06dbbf75dfaa4d738956ae31, recorded by a second reviewer in the same review: both say no test renders or parses examples/path-05-continuation (.path.json snapshot, .path.jsonl validate).","supersedes":"ff224c429d0763e1b514cf56a7090e58e7fbd9a5480e864baf36c945813632cf","tags":["reason:duplicate","session:claude-code:2b4a790f-c163-4549-93fa-572ef111cb5e"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/path-cli/tests/render_md_snapshots.rs","issuer":"mailto:benbarber121@gmail.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T18:56:11.494940Z","id":"ff49a9fb91945a81b36198e7d729896c9e04c40d6e6dae1b5bd1e723afda920b","body":{"detail":"Owner approval, 2026-10-13. path-05 is the only fixture that exercises the Parent header line, so it must be read by a test. Rides along in the #354 fix pass.","kind":"decision","references":"55b81cf621d13652b2a15dad792efbb816d4a7ef06dbbf75dfaa4d738956ae31","suggested_fix":"Add snapshot_test!(render_md_path_05_continuation, \"path-05-continuation.path.json\") with its snapshot, and an integration test that parses path-05-continuation.path.jsonl and asserts its path.parent equals the .json example's.","summary":"Decided: fix as suggested; the continuation example gets a render snapshot and its JSONL form is parsed in a test","tags":["review:pr-354-qual-2","decision","session:claude-code:2b4a790f-c163-4549-93fa-572ef111cb5e"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/path-cli/tests/render_md_snapshots.rs","issuer":"mailto:benbarber121@gmail.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T19:05:46.849612Z","id":"dd53c0b6b7ffff66a0f10fd997ebf46fd12a37abdd9c0649dac28124deb17344","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:41efc37","summary":"Fixed in 41efc37 on ben/path-parent: render_md_snapshots.rs adds snapshot_test!(render_md_path_05_continuation, ...) with its snapshot (shows the Parent header line), and integration.rs continuation_example_jsonl_matches_json_parent parses path-05-continuation.path.jsonl and asserts its path.parent equals the .path.json example's. cargo test -p path-cli passes.","supersedes":"55b81cf621d13652b2a15dad792efbb816d4a7ef06dbbf75dfaa4d738956ae31","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:2b4a790f-c163-4549-93fa-572ef111cb5e"]}}
